{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"酉群的三选二性质"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“酉群的三选二性质”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unitary_group#2-out-of-3_property\" title=\"Wikipedia 页面 [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unitary_group#2-out-of-3_property]\">Wikipedia 页面</a></span></p>\n<p>酉群 $U_n$ 是三个群 $O_{2n}$, $GL_n(\\mathbb{C})$, $Sp_{2n}$ 的交, 且等于其中任意两个的交. 这意味着, 在 Riemann 度量, 复结构和辛结构中任意两者 (只要满足相容性) 即可导出第三者.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Kähler流形","text":"Kähler 流形"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"近复结构","text":"近复结构"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}